    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see how things \"turn around\" when the people who did the damage are the ones getting promoted. it just feels like i'm playing a game where the rules are rigged against anyone with a conscience. i'm exhausted. not just tired, like i'm just... done. like there's no version of the future where this actually gets better, it just keeps getting heavier. does it ever actually stop? or is it just a constant cycle of trying to be decent and getting crushed for it?",
